		title = "Who Hires in the City",
		text = "Everyone in the City is hiring, and everyone hires differently. A Wing posts an exam at the Nest gate. An Association runs its own test and reports the result to Hana. A Fixer Office signs anyone who passes Hana's license exam and survives the first month.\n\nThe Fingers don't post notices. They notice you: how you bowed, whom you helped, what you did when the shooting started. A Bloodfiend Family offers its gift once.\n\nEvery offer comes with something to sign and something to carry: a badge, a coat, a book, a gun. Read the contract. Then read what isn't in it.",
